    {
      "clause": "Actual geometric coefficients and orientation",
      "assessment": "ordinaryWeight_cast and rootWeight_cast cast the actual integer vertex products term by term. The existing geometric near/far sampling definitions identify the reversed chirotope at their exact boundary triples. Ordinary factors become (D-H)/2; root factors become (D+H)/2, represented as the exact nearFarWeight with the far array negated. Both products retain every interior index and the empty product. The labelled representative and physical root g are the already reviewed source conventions."
